### Impact
Allowing malicious WebSocket clients to perform arbitrary LLM requests could leverage tools such as the shell tool to perform arbitrary commands leading to RCE. Other tools or prompts could be used to disclose sensitive information or perform expensive LLM requests to waste an organisations quota.
